step("x8-explore",X8,"Let us explore. Here B, E and R lie on a straight line, so angle B E R is a straight angle of 180 degrees. The angle T E R is 80 degrees, and S E R is 90 degrees. Angle B E T is the rest of the straight angle: 180 minus 80, which is 100 degrees. Angle S E T is the small gap between the two rays: 90 minus 80, which is 10 degrees.","ஆராய்வோம். B, E, R ஒரே நேர்கோட்டில், எனவே ∠BER நேர்கோணம் 180°. ∠TER = 80°, ∠SER = 90°. ∠BET என்பது நேர்கோணத்தின் மீதி: 180 − 80 = 100°. ∠SET என்பது இரு கதிர்களுக்கு இடையிலான சிறிய இடைவெளி: 90 − 80 = 10°.",[["clear","","",{}]]+sh(["exB","exR","exBl","exRl","exEl"],0.02,0.03)+sh(["exT","exTl","exa","exL1"],0.2,0.06)+sh(["exS","exSl","exb","exL2"],0.4,0.06)+sh(["exc","exL3"],0.65,0.08)+sh(["exL4"],0.85,0))
qs("x8-q1",X8,"In the figure, angle T E R is 80° and B E R is a straight line. What is angle B E T?","படத்தில் ∠TER = 80°, BER நேர்கோடு. ∠BET என்ன?","A straight angle is 180°:","நேர்கோணம் 180°:",1,[O("80°","80°","80° is ∠TER itself.","80° என்பது ∠TER தான்."),O("100°","100°"),O("10°","10°","10° is the gap ∠SET.","10° என்பது இடைவெளி ∠SET.")],"180° − 80° = 100°.","180° − 80° = 100°.",[["clear","","",{}]]+sh(["exB","exR","exBl","exRl","exEl","exT","exTl","exa","exL1","exc"],0.02,0.03))
qs("x8-q2",X8,"Then what is angle S E T if S E R is 90°?","∠SER = 90° எனில் ∠SET?","90° − 80°:","90° − 80°:",2,[O("170°","170°","That adds instead of subtracting.","அது கழிக்காமல் கூட்டுகிறது."),O("80°","80°","80° is ∠TER.","80° என்பது ∠TER."),O("10°","10°")],"The gap between 80° and 90° is 10°.","80° க்கும் 90° க்கும் இடையிலான இடைவெளி 10°.")
