step("x9-rays",X9,"Two figures with rays from one point. In the first, read each angle with the protractor along XA: angle A X B is 65 degrees, angle B X C is 30 degrees, angle C X E is 85 degrees, and angle B X E is 115 degrees, which is 30 plus 85. In the second, from Q: angle P Q R is 45 degrees, angle P Q S is 100 degrees and angle P Q T is 150 degrees.","ஒரு புள்ளியிலிருந்து கதிர்களுடன் இரு படங்கள். முதலில் XA வழியே அளந்தால்: ∠AXB = 65°, ∠BXC = 30°, ∠CXE = 85°, ∠BXE = 115° (30 + 85). இரண்டாவதில் Q இலிருந்து: ∠PQR = 45°, ∠PQS = 100°, ∠PQT = 150°.",[CL]+wr(["raT","rbH"],0.02,0.03)+sh(["raA","raAl","raB","raBl","raC","raCl","raE","raEl","raO"],0.1,0.03)+sh(["rbP","rbPl","rbR","rbRl","rbS","rbSl","rbT","rbTl","rbO"],0.35,0.03)+wr(["raU","rbU"],0.8,0.1))
qs("x9-q1",X9,"In the first figure, ∠BXC = 30° and ∠CXE = 85°. What is ∠BXE?","முதல் படத்தில் ∠BXC = 30°, ∠CXE = 85°. ∠BXE என்ன?","Add the two parts:","இரு பகுதிகளைக் கூட்டுங்கள்:",1,[O("55°","55°","55° is 85° − 30°, but the two parts add.","55° என்பது 85° − 30°; ஆனால் இரு பகுதிகளையும் கூட்ட வேண்டும்."),O("115°","115°"),O("65°","65°","65° is ∠AXB, a different angle.","65° என்பது ∠AXB, வேறு கோணம்.")],"30° + 85° = 115°.","30° + 85° = 115°.")
qs("x9-q2",X9,"∠PQS = 100° and ∠PQR = 45°. What is ∠RQS?","∠PQS = 100°, ∠PQR = 45°. ∠RQS என்ன?","Subtract the smaller from the larger:","பெரியதிலிருந்து சிறியதைக் கழியுங்கள்:",0,[O("55°","55°"),O("145°","145°","145° adds the two angles instead of subtracting.","145° என்பது கூட்டியது, கழிக்கவில்லை."),O("100°","100°","100° is the whole ∠PQS.","100° என்பது முழு ∠PQS.")],"100° − 45° = 55°.","100° − 45° = 55°.")
